{
 "header": [
  "The page's whole-game plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, about 50 minutes: every solo mission on",
  "Agent in the game's order, for a card that asks for the whole game (a play this long is not a regular one: that",
  "repo's docs/playing.md, Which browser, how long). It boots as tools/play_plan_extended.json does, to the file menu,",
  "where tools/shader_survey.js makes an Agent file on the Game Pak as New Agent does, for each mission's end to save",
  "to, and starts dataDyne Central - Defection as mission select's Accept does (patches/shader_survey.c). Each",
  "mission's opening cutscene is watched to its end (Space only after 3 minutes), then Joanna is made invincible and",
  "plays the extended plan's moves, about 45 s of the game's time on its own clock (g_Vars.lvframe240): out and back by",
  "as much about where the level starts her, strafing, turning, firing and aiming. Then the survey's complete() ends the",
  "mission as its own script does once its objectives are done, every objective counted complete: the endscreen says",
  "Mission Completed and saves to the file, and Continue (Enter) on it and Accept on the next mission's screen start the",
  "next mission, the game's own way from one to the next (the survey starts it only if they don't). Each mission is",
  "behind a need that fails the run unless its stage is the one playing and Joanna is in control. Skedar Ruins'",
  "Continue plays the credits, a minute of them (they end on a still picture no button leaves, credits.c), and the",
  "four special assignments (Mr. Blonde's Revenge, Maian SOS, WAR!, The Duel) are started from there by the survey,",
  "each ended the same way. A console line 'full plan: mission <n> of 21, <name>' marks each mission's start in",
  "play_page's output. It plays no level's outro cutscene: those start where a level's script finds Joanna at its end,",
  "which no plan walks her to."
 ],
 "page": "PerfectDarkRecompiled.html",
